{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Detective Nielsen. Good that you're here. We've got a homicide.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You're a detective in the first real VR investigation game in 1986 in New Orleans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the city and interrogate unforgettable characters in this unique take on a classic Point&amp;Click adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A man was murdered. Not just any man. John Malone, a promising city council member. Step into a world where every cigarette holds a clue, and every whiskey glass reflects a lie. In this groundbreaking VR experience, you're more than just a player \u2013 you're the detective who might crack the case...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSE YOURSELF IN DETECTIVE WORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282790/extras/Hall_01.gif?t=1738074054\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore photorealistic environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282790/extras/BOB_01.gif?t=1738074054\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrogate and question lifelike characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282790/extras/Newspaper_01.gif?t=1738074054\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues that other players won't</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282790?t=1738074054","background_raw":"https://sto